# Product hero images (JSON-driven `/products/[slug]`)

When adding or updating **`media.heroImage`** in `content/products/*.json`, follow this so headers **float on the cream section** without a fake “card,” tilt, or heavy shadow.

## Layout rules (implemented in `ProductPageFromJson.tsx`)

1. **No 3D tilt** — Do not wrap the hero in `perspective` / `rotateY` / `rotateX`. That read as a physical panel with its own lighting.
2. **No container drop shadow** — Do not use `shadow-[0_18px_40px_-14px_...]` (or similar) on the hero frame; it draws a box on the page.
3. **Match the section** — Hero image uses **`bg-cream`** with **`object-contain`** and **`object-center`** (or `lg:object-right` where the art is intentionally biased) so letterboxing matches `section.bg-cream`.
4. **Clip soft outer fringes** — Use **`overflow-hidden`** on the hero frame and a slight **`scale(1.04)`** with **`transform-origin: center`** on the image so baked-in outer shadows or white mats in PNGs are trimmed without changing the JSON path.
5. **Sharp delivery** — Prefer **`quality={92}`** (or equivalent) on hero `next/image` for local PNGs.

## Assets

- Prefer **hero PNGs** with **no extra white plate** or drop shadow around the composite (transparent or cream bleed is ideal).
- **JPGs** in `New Images` folders are for reference only unless explicitly wired in JSON.

## Accordion / tabs

**Alternating story** (`hero.storyAlternating`) uses the Brand Monitoring zigzag layout (`alternating-story-section.tsx`) — e.g. **website-design**, **hosting**, **reputation-management**, **directories**, **ecommerce**, **ppc-management** (Marketing 360).

Sidebar images for accordions, vertical tabs, etc. stay in **`hero.sidebar.items[].image`**; use **`quality={92}`** on those `Image` components where applicable (see `product-hero-accordion.tsx`, `vertical-tabs.tsx`, `interactive-image-accordion.tsx`).

### Vertical tabs (`vertical-tabs.tsx` — slugs like **logo-design**, **ssl**, **website-builder**, **email-marketing**, **social-media-management**, **seo**)

- **`body`** with **multiple lines** (newline-separated) renders as a **left-aligned** list with **brand teal dots** (`bg-teal`); leading `•` in JSON is stripped so only the UI dots show.
- **Single paragraph** `body` (no newlines) stays one left-aligned block (e.g. long prose in one paragraph per item).
- Optional **`icon`** on each sidebar item (Lucide name) shows above the copy under the gallery.
